sequenceDiagram
  participant M as MacGuard
  participant V as ChannelVerifier
  M->>M: extract package into staging
  M->>V: signature of manifest.json ok
  V->>V: SHA-256 of every listed file
  V-->>M: one file does not match the manifest
  M->>M: release is not trustworthy, delete staging
  M->>M: keep the installed rules
